        "name": "English",
        "english_name": "English",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "https://www.onecool.com/tc/film/beyond-the-sin/",
          "overview": "Allen Lok, a Macau Judicial Police inspector, is devastated when his daughter is found murdered. Suspect Manny Yau is arrested and convicted, but when another girl is killed months later, Lok begins to doubt that the real killer is behind bars. Determined to uncover the truth, he reopens the case, uncovering dark secrets and suspicions.",
          "runtime": 82,
